msgid ""
"The structural pattern matching feature is discussed in `issue #7847 "
"<https://github.com/micropython/micropython/issues/7847>`_."
msgstr ""
"Yapısal desen eşleştirme özelliği `issue #7847 "
"<https://github.com/micropython/micropython/issues/7847>`_ içinde "
"tartışılmaktadır."
